<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>For Ayushi ❤️</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    color: white;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background: #160d25;
}

/* Main background */
.page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.35), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(150, 100, 255, 0.30), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(255, 160, 100, 0.25), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #160d25, #28113d, #41142f);
}

/* Floating hearts and stars */
.particle {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -20px;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: floatUp linear infinite;
    opacity: 0.7;
    z-index: 2;
    font-size: 20px;
}

@keyframes floatUp {
    0% {
        transform: translateY(0) scale(0.7) rotate(0deg);
        opacity: 0;
    }

    15% {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    100% {
        transform: translateY(-110vh) scale(1.2) rotate(360deg);
        opacity: 0;
    }
}

/* Every section */
section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    position: relative;
}

/* Opening */
.hero {
    text-align: center;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.small-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(60px, 15vw, 110px);
    line-height: 1;

    background: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        #ffd1e8,
        #ffffff,
        #ffd0a8
    );

    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;

    animation: glow 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow {
    from {
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255, 150, 200, 0.3));
    }

    to {
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 25px rgba(255, 150, 200, 0.8));
    }
}

.hero p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 25px auto;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #f9eaf5;
}

.start-btn {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 14px 30px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50px;

    background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #ff6fae,
        #a56cff
    );

    color: white;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;

    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 80, 160, 0.3);

    transition: 0.3s;
}

.start-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.04);
}

/* Birthday section */
.birthday {
    text-align: center;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.birthday h2 {
    font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 85px);
    color: #ffd5e8;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.birthday-message {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 2;
    color: #f9eaf5;
}

/* Birthday cake */
.cake {
    position: relative;
    width: 170px;
    height: 130px;
    margin: 45px auto 30px;
}

.layer {
    position: absolute;
    width: 170px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 15px;

    background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #ff8fbd,
        #ff5d9d
    );

    left: 0;

    box-shadow:
        inset 0 -8px rgba(150, 30, 90, 0.12);
}

.layer:nth-child(1) {
    bottom: 0;
}

.layer:nth-child(2) {
    bottom: 38px;
    width: 145px;
    left: 12px;
}

.layer:nth-child(3) {
    bottom: 76px;
    width: 115px;
    left: 27px;
}

.candle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 9px;
    height: 35px;
    background: #ffe9a8;
    top: -35px;
    left: 80px;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

.flame {
    position: absolute;
    width: 14px;
    height: 20px;
    background: #ffd166;

    border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0%;

    transform: rotate(-45deg);

    top: -53px;
    left: 77px;

    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ffb347;

    animation: flicker 0.7s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes flicker {
    from {
        transform: rotate(-45deg) scale(0.9);
    }

    to {
        transform: rotate(-45deg) scale(1.1);
    }
}

/* Photo section */
.memory {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
}

.memory h2 {
    font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size: 60px;
    color: #ffd5e8;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.photo-frame {
    width: min(85vw, 380px);
    padding: 10px;

    border-radius: 25px;

    background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #ff8fbd,
        #9b6cff,
        #ffd18b
    );

    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);

    transform: rotate(-2deg);

    transition: 0.5s;
}

.photo-frame:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.03);
}

.photo-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 18px;
}

/* Tafree section */
.tafree {
    text-align: center;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.tafree-card {
    max-width: 720px;

    padding: 45px 30px;

    border-radius: 30px;

    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);

    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);

    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.tafree-card .heart {
    font-size: 45px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.tafree-card p {
    font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #ffe0ee;
}

/* Final section */
.final {
    text-align: center;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.final h2 {
    font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(55px, 11vw, 90px);
    color: #ffd5e8;
}

.final p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-top: 25px;

    line-height: 2;

    font-size: 17px;

    color: #f9eaf5;
}

.signature {
    margin-top: 35px;

    font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;

    font-size: 35px;

    color: #ffc6df;
}

/* Music button */
.music-btn {
    position: fixed;

    right: 20px;
    bottom: 20px;

    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;

    border-radius: 50%;

    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);

    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);

    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

    color: white;

    font-size: 20px;

    cursor: pointer;

    z-index: 20;
}

/* Mobile */
@media (max-width: 600px) {

    section {
        padding: 50px 18px;
    }

    .hero p,
    .birthday-message,
    .final p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .tafree-card {
        padding: 35px 20px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page">

    <!-- Floating decorations -->

    <div class="particle" style="left:5%; animation-duration:12s;">♡</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:12%; animation-duration:16s; animation-delay:2s;">✦</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:22%; animation-duration:13s; animation-delay:4s;">♥</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:35%; animation-duration:18s; animation-delay:1s;">✧</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:48%; animation-duration:14s; animation-delay:5s;">♡</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:60%; animation-duration:17s; animation-delay:3s;">✦</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:73%; animation-duration:12s; animation-delay:6s;">♥</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:85%; animation-duration:16s; animation-delay:2s;">✧</div>
    <div class="particle" style="left:94%; animation-duration:14s; animation-delay:4s;">♡</div>


    <!-- Opening -->

    <section class="hero">

        <div class="small-text">
            A little something for you...
        </div>

        <h1>
            Hey, Ayushi ❤️
        </h1>

        <p>
            I was going to simply wish you a happy birthday...
            <br>
            but then I remembered that you're not exactly
            someone who deserves a simple wish.
        </p>

        <button
            class="start-btn"
            onclick="scrollToBirthday()">

            I made this for you ✨

        </button>

    </section>


    <!-- Birthday -->

    <section
        class="birthday"
        id="birthday">

        <h2>
            Happy Birthday, Beautiful! 🎂
        </h2>

        <div class="cake">

            <div class="layer"></div>
            <div class="layer"></div>
            <div class="layer"></div>

            <div class="candle"></div>

            <div class="flame"></div>

        </div>

        <p class="birthday-message">

            Today is about celebrating you...
            the person who somehow manages to make ordinary moments
            feel a little less ordinary.

            <br><br>

            I hope this year brings you the kind of happiness
            that stays, the kind of smiles that don't need a reason,
            and countless moments that you'll want to remember forever.

            <br><br>

            And selfishly, I hope I get to be part of quite a few
            of those moments. ❤️

        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- Photo -->

    <section class="memory">

        <h2>
            One Little Memory 📸
        </h2>

        <div class="photo-frame">

            <img
                src="YOUR_PHOTO_HERE.jpg"
                alt="A beautiful memory">

        </div>

        <p style="
            margin-top:30px;
            max-width:600px;
            line-height:1.8;
        ">

            One picture isn't nearly enough to capture everything,
            but I thought this one deserved a little place here.

        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- Tafree -->

    <section class="tafree">

        <div class="tafree-card">

            <div class="heart">
                💗
            </div>

            <p>

                Some places are just places...
                until the right person makes them memories.

            </p>

            <br>

            <p style="
                font-size:22px;
                color:#f8d8e8;
            ">

                And honestly, I really miss those little moments
                of doing absolutely nothing and somehow having
                the best time with you at Tafree.

            </p>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Final message -->

    <section class="final">

        <h2>
            For You, Ayushi ❤️
        </h2>

        <p>

            I don't know what the coming year has planned for you,
            but I hope it is kind to you.

            <br><br>

            Keep smiling that beautiful smile.
            Keep being the wonderfully annoying, adorable,
            and completely unforgettable person you are.

            <br><br>

            And if life ever gets a little too serious,
            remember that somewhere out there is someone
            who would still choose to spend another random
            evening laughing with you over absolutely nothing.

            <br><br>

            Happy Birthday, Ayushi.

            <br>

            You are, and will always be,
            a little more special to me than I know how to explain. ❤️

        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            With love ❤️
        </div>

    </section>

</div>


<!-- Music button -->

<button
    class="music-btn"
    onclick="toggleMusic()"
    id="musicButton">

    🎵

</button>


<audio
    id="music"
    loop>

    <source
        src="YOUR_MUSIC_HERE.mp3"
        type="audio/mpeg">

</audio>


<script>

function scrollToBirthday() {

    document
        .getElementById("birthday")
        .scrollIntoView({
            behavior: "smooth"
        });

}


let musicPlaying = false;


function toggleMusic() {

    const music =
        document.getElementById("music");

    const button =
        document.getElementById("musicButton");


    if (musicPlaying) {

        music.pause();

        button.innerHTML = "🎵";

        musicPlaying = false;

    } else {

        music.play();

        button.innerHTML = "🔊";

        musicPlaying = true;

    }

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
